&lt;p&gt;物品：&lt;strong&gt;小米手环9pro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
个数：&lt;strong&gt;1个&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
物流：&lt;strong&gt;小米京东自营旗舰店&lt;/strong&gt;（所在地需要京东自营物流支持）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/1/2/8124d2994e42c74a7678edec82d97111e9cc4cc5.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/iqsu7CXKQ9X1euVnkM687OHQfB3.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/1/2/8124d2994e42c74a7678edec82d97111e9cc4cc5_2_690x492.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;iqsu7CXKQ9X1euVnkM687OHQfB3&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;492&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/1/2/8124d2994e42c74a7678edec82d97111e9cc4cc5_2_690x492.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/1/2/8124d2994e42c74a7678edec82d97111e9cc4cc5.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/1/2/8124d2994e42c74a7678edec82d97111e9cc4cc5.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;D6D5E3&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
